{"id":"66e9948187c8","publishedAt":1795798800000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"【叡王戦】豊島将之九段が木村一基九段に勝ち、本戦進出"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-34.html","text":"叡王戦"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/27"},{"text":"17:00"},{"text":"16"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n\n●　森内俊之　　木村一基　○"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://blog-imgs-187.fc2.com/i/2/c/i2chmeijin/20261127095419f8c.png"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"href":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/eiou/12/yosen.html","text":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/eiou/12/yosen.html"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" △76馬まで効くのか。勝ち将棋鬼のごとし。。。 "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 木村おめ。しかし1時間半後に午前抜け番の豊島豊島指すのはキツイね "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" おじさん、王位戦を思い出すんや "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" そういやこのカード王位戦か "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 懐かしいな "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" あの時の王位戦で何で豊島が負けたか未だに分からん。おじさん応援ではあったけど "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n○　豊島将之　　木村一基　●\n"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" あら▲24飛が受からんのか。一杯食わされたか "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" うーん、無惨。。。せめて豊島も午前対局があれば "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1787131724/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24139.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24139.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24139.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24139.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(16)"}]],"comments":[]}